{"product_id":"iqos-lil-solid-2-0","title":"IQOS Lil Solid 2.0","description":"\u003cp\u003eEasy to use all-in-one device, with 25 sessions on one full charge, and the time of each session is increased to about 5 minutes.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIQOS introduces Lil Solid 2.0 to bring a smoke-free future even closer.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eImagine a world where everything is simple, easy and convenient. A world where there is nothing superfluous, but the most important thing remains. A world of enjoying the taste of real tobacco, but without smoke and ash.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe tobacco in \u003ca title=\"Iqos devices\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/iqos-iluma\"\u003eIQOS device\u003c\/a\u003e Lil Solid 2.0 heats up rather than burns, so there is no fire or ash during use. This means that there is no risk of burning your clothes or furniture, and you do not risk damaging the carpet or upholstery in the car by falling ash.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAlso when using Lil Solid 2.0, tobacco vapor (aerosol) is emitted, so there is no smell of cigarette smoke.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpecifications:-\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eReleased: 2021\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDevice type: All-in-one\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eManufacturer: KT\u0026amp;G, introduced by PMI\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging port type: USB-C\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions: 106 ? 31 ? 22 mm \/ 4.17 x 1.22 x 0.87 in\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWeight: 99 g \/ 3.5 oz\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery capacity: 2950 mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConsecutive uses: 3\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUses per full charge: 25\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging time: 2 h\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeating temperature: 350 °C (660 °F)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeating method: Heating pin\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeating time: 25 sec\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompatible Sticks type: \u003ca title=\"Fiit cigarettes\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/iqos-fiit\"\u003eFiit cigarettes\u003c\/a\u003e, \u0026amp; \u003ca title=\"Heets cigarettes\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/heets-cigarette\"\u003eHeets cigarettes\u003c\/a\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSession length: 5 minutes or 14 puff\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41807728967735,"sku":"Lil Solid 2.0","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/lil-solid-20-stone-grey-super-shipping-2.webp?v=1754265999","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/iqos-lil-solid-2-0","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




